Question 1: Spring Boot Data JPA – University Course
Management System (@OneToMany Unidirectional)
Scenario
Develop a Spring Boot application for a University Management System where one University
offers multiple Courses. Store university and course details using Spring Data JPA and establish a
Unidirectional One-to-Many relationship. In this application, navigation should be possible only
from University to Course.
