• Use @OneToMany in University.
• Use @JoinColumn to create the foreign key.
• Do not use @ManyToOne in Course.
• Use CascadeType.ALL.
• This relationship must be Unidirectional.
Requirements
1. Create University and Course entities.
String
Double
2. Configure a Unidirectional @OneToMany relationship.
3. Save one University with multiple Courses.
4. Retrieve University details along with Course information.
5. Use Spring Data JPA Repository.
6. Display data using CommandLineRunner.
7. Store the foreign key in the Course table using @JoinColumn.
